    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a pretty strong stance. I want to make sure the podcast doesn't look like it's just one-sided, so what would a company like Apple or Microsoft say to defend themselves against those \"predatory\" accusations? Like, what's their actual legal argument for keeping things closed off?",
